Package: neutr
Title: Inference and Fast Generation of Neutral Species Assemblages
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Jerome", "Chave", , "jerome.chave@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation of the parameters of three neutral
    models of species assemblages (the Ewens model, the multideme model and the
    Pitman model), and fast, exact generation of typical species abundance
    distributions of the Ewens and Pitman models given their parameters.
    Calculations scale to very large samples, on the order of 10^12 individuals.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/jeromechave/neutr
BugReports: https://github.com/jeromechave/neutr/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    dqrng,
    stats
